{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1415136-wonders-as-focuses-and-personalized-instrument-rules","id":1415136,"title":"Wonders as Focuses? And Personalized Instrument Rules.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-22T17:18:45-07:00","id":1415136,"title":"Wonders as Focuses? And Personalized Instrument Rules.","content":"Can a mage use a wonder as a focus? If so then I have a question:<br /> <br /> If the wonder is a &quot;personalized instrument&quot; will the Wonder recieve the -1 to the sphere roll as well?<br /> <br /> Example: A wonderous sword that employs the Forces sphere to increase its momentum and is a personalized instrument giving -1 diff to forces sphere. Will the sword's arete roll recieve the -1 diff as well. All wonder rolls are at diff 7, so in this case would it become diff 6?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26413-thatonekiasyd","name":"ThatOneKiasyd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26413_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-22T17:39:35-07:00","id":1415138,"title":"","content":"I apply any relevant modifiers to wonders for their own because difficulty 7 default is kind of silly, especially for a 2 dot coincidental effect. If the mage made the wonder their self, id let them count it as personalized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26088-actual_table","name":"Actual_Table","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26088_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-22T18:55:21-07:00","id":1415145,"title":"","content":"Wonders can be instruments, including the more specific mechanical types of them.<br /> <br /> Wonders work in a lot of different ways, but I wouldn't assume that they can provide instrument bonuses to themselves. You can operate a Wonder without using any Instruments. The offset to this is that Wonders generally have a small internal quintessence &quot;battery&quot; just for spending on their spell's activation and difficulty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}